  "description": "Height-to-normal strength sweep with every texture set's method set to 'Smooth (Sobel)' through Painter's UI. Painter 12.1.5 has no height-to-normal strength setting, so the sweep scales the height signal (decision 047): per texture set of the 4x2 plane grid the authored height ramps at one amplitude, as fill opacity or as copies stacked in LinearDodge (s0 opacity 1, s1 opacity 0.75, s2 opacity 0.5, s3 opacity 0.25, s4 opacity 0.1, s5 x2, s6 x3, s7 x4). Normal_OpenGL and Normal_DirectX virtual maps (PNG 16), Height and Normal channels (OpenEXR 32f).",
